out.push(S('Stage 3R · Perform – listener task'));
out.push(A('The finding is **the gap between the two columns**, and it is audible in the room: where the gap is one or two, the sentence was a description of something already happening; where it is six or nine, the sentence is a commitment, and the speaker hears that for themselves as they say the second figure. ⚠ Where a speaker cannot answer _what is the number now?_ at all, the future perfect has no business being used: stop and have them say instead _I have not started counting_, which is honest and is 23.5.'));
out.push(S('Stage 4 · Your turn (sample)'));
