out.push(S('Stage 7P · Respond (sample slip — criterion named)'));
out.push(A('_Three sentences, each naming its criterion:_ **"On each verb matched to its evidence: the form and the instalment for the first, four people and an unfilled post for the third, and the paragraph explaining why you wrote _aim_ is the one I shall copy. On the intention attached today: a name, a Thursday, a diary and the morning the entry goes in — mine says _soon_, and I can see now what that is worth. On the reason marked pattern or judgement: one minute is one instance and you said so before anybody could say it for you, which is the only line on the page that could not have been written in September."**'));
