out.push(A('**Read out the test date and the blind half only**, and then put the sheet on the wall where the September one went — one line each, a name, a date, and nobody takes anything down. It is read on the first of June by whoever is in the room, including students who have not yet enrolled. ⚠ The sentence to end on is the one the whole two years has been for: **the prediction is the cheap half**, and in two years the only thing on these sheets that has changed is the reason.'));
